# Competition repository safety rules
# 1. Keep the dataset provider's original wells, jobs and failure data private.
# 2. Keep the well-level model predictions and trained models private as well.
# 3. Commit source scripts and aggregate non-sensitive plots only after review.
# 4. This file replaces/extends the old .gitignore; do not delete old data.

# Local Python tooling
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
.env
.env*

# Original and processed competition datasets, even if placed in root
/data/

# Review /results output before publishing; aggregate metrics are usually okay.
data/
outputs/
models/
*.parquet
*.joblib
.venv/
__pycache__/
